.TH SDL_HINT_EGL_LIBRARY 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_EGL_LIBRARY \- Specify the EGL library to load.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_EGL_LIBRARY \(dqSDL_EGL_LIBRARY\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This hint should be set before creating an OpenGL window or creating an OpenGL context\[char46] This hint is only considered if SDL is using EGL to manage OpenGL contexts\[char46] If this hint isn\(aqt set, SDL will choose a reasonable default\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

